The authors used generative AI-based tools (Anthropic Claude Code) to assist
with (a) the implementation of baseline reimplementations and orchestration
scripts, (b) revisions to prose for conciseness and conformance to the
PoPETs~2027 formatting requirements. The attack implementations (Yeom
threshold MIA, shared-shadow LiRA, FUIA) and the FORGE training and erasure
code were cross-checked against the published algorithm descriptions and, where
public reference code was available, against those implementations as detailed
in Appendix~\ref{app:baseline-attribution}. All experimental design, theoretical
arguments, formal proofs, numerical results, and interpretation are the
authors' own. The authors have manually verified and are responsible for the
accuracy, originality, and integrity of the output of all AI-based tools.
